                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/2655: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-10-07T12:00:00-05:00">October 7,
                        1941—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:22 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>464. Export-Import Bank loan approved by both Houses, now goes to President for
                    signature.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Braden</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
